		{
			"id": "ewomwA-LIkpxwyLz5",
			"description": "Blaster",
			"local_notes": "Armour divisor (10).\n\nLore: A rifle-scale dark-lance weapon issued to Kabalite Trueborn and Sybarite squads when the Kabal expects armour: a short-range beam of anti-tank capability (Codex: Drukhari background). Its reach is short and its cells hold few shots.\n\nDesign: Framework anchor: 6dx3(10) burn, short range. It sits between the blast pistol (6dx2) and the dark lance (6dx4) at the same 6d core. Exact dice: average 63; effective DR under divisor (10) is 3, 7, 10 and 19 for flak, carapace, Astartes and Terminator armour, so it penetrates every one of them 100.0% of hits. Vehicles (DR 100/150/200/275/350): 100.0/100.0/100.0/99.8/99.0%. Handling: 8 lb loaded (a light two-handed rifle housing around a lance core), min ST 9 (sqrt(80)=8.9). RoF 1 (recharge). Shots 5(4): a modest cell, one more than the blast pistol. Range 40/120: twice the pistol's, a fraction of the dark lance's. Acc 3 (a short-barrelled beam rifle, framework: carbines 3-4, beams slightly better), Bulk -4, Rcl 1.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari",
