		{
			"id": "eWL5GnkdXrw-lYc18",
			"description": "Shredder",
			"local_notes": "Shots are cartridges of net-charge. Targets may Dodge as usual: a successful Dodge avoids both the cut and the net. The net wraps on any hit, whether or not the cut penetrates DR.\n\nLore: A close-range Kabal weapon: a launcher that throws a spreading burst of monofilament wire that tangles and cuts (Codex: Drukhari background), carried by Kabalite Warriors and Trueborn to break up charges and pin targets for the poisoned weapons of the squad.\n\nDesign: The framework anchor is 'monofilament net: short-range area weapon that entangles and cuts (Binding plus cut damage)'. The cut uses the same dice and divisor as the splinter rifle (4d(3), monomolecular edge), rolled per target across a 6-yard cone as the Basic Set flamethrower cone rule does (B281): exact dice give flak (effective 10) 84.1%, carapace 0.1% (3.6% with WP), Astartes 0.0%. The entanglement is the weapon's real effect, and is modelled as Binding with ST 14, DR 3 rather than a further damage roll: a bound target cannot use its weapons or move until it breaks free, and each turn of struggling shreds it (1d(3) cut). Handling: 6 lb, min ST 8 (sqrt(60)=7.7); RoF 1 (a net-charge launcher, not automatic); Shots 4(4); Bulk -3. Acc and Rcl are omitted: a cone weapon has neither.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari",
				"Kabal"
			],
			"tech_level": "10^",
			"legality_class": "0",
			"base_value": "2500",
			"base_weight": "6 lb",
			"weapons": [
				{
					"id": "W3MhyzDG_Yx4_FkRa",
					"sv": 1,
					"damage": {
						"type": "cut",
						"base": "4d",
						"armor_divisor": 3
					},
					"range": "6",
					"rate_of_fire": "1",
					"shots": "4(4)",
					"bulk": "-3",
					"strength": "8",
					"usage": "Cone (6 yards)",
					"usage_notes": "No Acc bonus applies and no aiming roll is needed against a target inside the cone; the skill roll is only to avoid intervening obstacles. Each target in the cone is rolled separately.",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "dx",
							"modifier": -4
						},
						{
							"type": "skill",
							"name": {
								"compare": "is",
