		{
			"id": "e9l3C1vgwPIV5iCr9",
			"description": "Stinger Pistol",
			"local_notes": "A quiet poisoner's weapon. Its dart does almost nothing to armour; it is for the unarmoured throat and the gap in a plate joint.\n\nLore: A small dart pistol firing toxic needles, in the sources a Drukhari poisoner's weapon: background mentions toxic dart weapons among the Drukhari, but I do not have a canonical listing or owner for this exact name, so this entry is built from the framework's 'toxic dart' description alone.\n\nDesign: The framework says only 'toxic dart'. 1d(3) pi- is deliberately negligible (0.0% against flak, 0.0% against carapace: penetrates nothing armoured) and the real weapon is the 3d tox follow-up (average 10.5), which requires the dart to penetrate: it is therefore an assassin's weapon aimed at unarmoured locations, the same 'follow-up carries the threat' principle as the Aeldari mandiblasters. Handling: 1.5 lb, min ST 4 (sqrt(15)=3.9). RoF 2 (a pneumatic dart gun with a slow cycling action, below a splinter pistol's 4). Acc 2, Shots 8(3), range 30/100, Bulk -1, Rcl 1.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari",
				"Kabal",
				"Haemonculus Coven"
			],
			"tech_level": "10^",
			"legality_class": "0",
			"base_value": "800",
