		{
			"id": "enDYlWCRABxM1VXkX",
			"description": "Plasma Grenade, Drukhari Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A hand-thrown plasma charge carried by Wyches and Kabalite leaders to close with armoured targets (Codex: Drukhari background gives them to Wyches, and I am less sure of who else carries them).\n\nDesign: Half the plasma anchor's dice (3d) at the same x4 multiplier and (3) divisor, as every grenade in this project is built from its parent weapon: 3dx4(3) burn ex averages 42, effective DR under divisor (3) is 10, 23.3, 33.3 and 63.3. Exact dice: penetrates flak 100.0%, carapace 95.4%, Astartes plate 74.1% (74.5% with WP), Terminator plate 4.6%. Weight 1.2 lb and cost 900 are set a little under the Aeldari pattern (a Commorragh mass-produced charge). No Acc/RoF/ST/Bulk/Rcl figures apply to a hand-thrown weapon.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari",
				"Wych Cult"
			],
